MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225347] = {name = "Umbral Tin", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Umbral Tin is distinguished from its less impressive cousin by the deep shade of the ore. It resembles the inky black sky. Umbral Tin is more durable yet also more flexible than most other metals.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225348] = {name = "Brilliant Silver", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]A higher grade of silver, Brilliant Silver's shine is as unmatched as its magical conductive properties. It is highly sought after as the epitome of form and function.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225349] = {name = "Rich Refulgent Copper", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nFortunate is the miner that comes across a rich deposit. These deposits contain a surplus of ore.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225350] = {name = "Refulgent Copper Seam", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nOre seams form in caves and underground. They offer more resources for the intrepid miner that dares to find them.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225351] = {name = "Lightfused Refulgent Copper", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nDrenched in the Sunwell's glow, some ore deposits in Quel'Thalas gleam with incredible radiance. Touching these deposits will release motes of holy energy that burn if caught, but yield additional resources.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225352] = {name = "Voidbound Refulgent Copper", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nAdventurers are no strangers to the Void and its adverse effects. Nothing can escape its touch, from dragon aspects to humble ore deposits. Gathering Voidbound ore provokes it, causing the swirling energies to coalesce into a terrifyi- [the entry suddenly cuts off].\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225353] = {name = "Wild Refulgent Copper", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nZul'Aman is rife with natural magic from the eons that Amani society has lived there. Occasionally, this magic is imbued into ore deposits. Be wary while gathering these deposits, lest Zul'Aman itself fight back.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1225354] = {name = "Primal Refulgent Copper", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Copper veins have long populated Azeroth. Through a combination of advances in Mining techniques and copper veins bathing in magical energies, the newly-dubbed Refulgent Copper is quickly becoming an essential metal in Quel'Thalas.\n\nHarandar pulses with the magic of life itself. Gathering an ore deposit filled with this magic will replenish a portion of abilities for your Skyriding mount.\nDiscovery:\nMidnight Gathering Nodes"}
