MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1230477] = {name = "[q3]Prismatic Focusing Iris", additional_info = "2 sec cast\nTools: Jeweler's Tools\nReagents:\nSin'dorei Lens (2), Glimmering Gemdust (2)\nOptional Reagents:\nDrop:\nLothraxion\nZone:\nNexus-Point Xenas\n\n[q3]Prismatic Focusing Iris\nOptional Crafting Reagent\n[q2]+15 Recipe Difficulty\n[q2]Provides the following property: Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate the Iris, firing a focused beam of light at your target and dealing ( 1 * 1102 ) Arcane damage every second for 4 sec.\n\n Each unique gem color you have socketed empowers the Iris, causing it to deal 1% additional damage per.\n[q]Usable with: Midnight recipes for most unembellished equipment.\n[q]\"Can be bought and sold on the Auction House.\""}
