MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1248579] = {name = "Adding", additional_info = "1.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nMandate of Sacred Death\n[q]When your delve companion casts Tools of the Trade , a Sacred Mandate is bestowed upon party members granting their harmful spells and abilities a [( 80 / 1000) * 100]% chance to deal 2 % of the target's maximum health as additional Holy damage per Mandate.\n\n Can only occur once per target every 2 sec.\n\n Mandate of Sacred Death has a very small chance to execute non-boss enemies.\n\n Tools of the Trade\nValeera uses her gathering tools to help players find additional gold, ore, herbs, fish, leathers, and treasures.\n\nUse: Add this Curio to your companion's collection."}
